 Thanks for this alternative, I think it's a better approach than my `sort_localized` filter.

The extra verbosity is fine to me, as `collate()` can be combined with other comparisons, for instance to sort by last name, then by first name:

  ```twig
  users|sort((a, b) => collate(a.lastname, b.lastname) ?: collate(a.firstname, b.firstname))
  ```
I've suggested an example for the docs.
